### 获取根路径
GET http://localhost:8080

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 创建AI角色
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/characters/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "编程助手",
  "system_prompt": "你是一个专业的编程助手，帮助解决健康问题",
  "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo"
}

### 获取角色列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/characters/?page=1&page_size=10

### 与角色对话
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/characters/{{character_id}}/speak
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "如何学习Python？",
  "character_id": "{{character_id}}"
}

### 获取角色统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/characters/{{character_id}}/stats